INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(2,'http://www.eumetsat.int/image-week-hurricane-simon','https://eumetsat.int/image-week-hurricane-simon','Image of the week: Hurricane Simon','imageoftheweekhurricanesimon','eumetsat','EUMETSAT news','en','2026-10-15T10:43:10Z','2026-10-17T08:43:42Z','Image of the week: Hurricane Simon Craig MacDonald Thu, 15/10/2026 - 12:43 Image of the week: Hurricane Simon Watching our Earth from space This week’s image shows Hurricane Simon in the eastern Pacific on 11 October 2026, as seen from one of the Copernicus Sentinel-3 satellites. Last Updated Published on Simon became a tropical storm in early October and strengthened as it tracked along the west coast of Mexico. By 10 October it had reached category 4 status with maximum sustained winds close to 240 km/h, and it then weakened over the following days. The hurricane brought strong winds, heavy ',2.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(3,'https://aiforgood.itu.int/designing-ai-education-around-childrens-agency/','https://aiforgood.itu.int/designing-ai-education-around-childrens-agency','Designing AI education around children’s agency','designingaieducationaroundchildrensagency','itu_ai4good','ITU AI for Good','en','2026-10-16T12:07:59Z','2026-10-17T08:43:45Z','Children are often presented as passive recipients of AI, expected to adapt to systems they did not design and cannot influence. At the AI for Good Global Summit 2026, Andrew Sliwinski, Vice President and Head of Product Experience at LEGO Education, challenged that narrative with a different question: “What if we focus on what children are capable of?” The post Designing AI education around children’s agency appeared first on AI for Good .',1.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(4,'https://aiforgood.itu.int/from-testing-to-trust-what-will-it-take-to-scale-autonomous-mobility/','https://aiforgood.itu.int/from-testing-to-trust-what-will-it-take-to-scale-autonomous-mobility','From testing to trust: What will it take to scale autonomous mobility?','fromtestingtotrustwhatwillittaketoscaleautonomousmobility','itu_ai4good','ITU AI for Good','en','2026-10-14T13:10:37Z','2026-10-17T08:43:45Z','Autonomous mobility is increasingly moving beyond pilots and demonstrations into real-world deployment. From driverless vehicles and autonomous aircraft to intelligent railways, many of the underlying technologies are already being deployed. The question is no longer whether autonomous mobility will arrive, but whether regulation, infrastructure and public trust can evolve quickly enough to support it. The post From testing to trust: What will it take to scale autonomous mobility? appeared first on AI for Good .',1.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(5,'https://www.preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/sensitivity-observed-changes-compound-climate-extremes','https://preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/sensitivity-observed-changes-compound-climate-extremes','Sensitivity of observed changes in compound climate extremes across Europe to event definition','sensitivityofobservedchangesincompoundclimateextremesacrosseuropetoeventdefinition','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-16T10:31:23Z','2026-10-17T08:43:45Z','This article assesses how definitions affect detected changes in compound climate extremes in Europe, finding that event frequency, intensity, and trends are sensitive to metric choice and recommends careful selection of event definitions for monitoring.',1.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(6,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/disasters-cost-228-billion-housing-losses-every-year','https://preventionweb.net/news/disasters-cost-228-billion-housing-losses-every-year','Disasters cost $228 billion in housing losses every year','disasterscost228billioninhousinglosseseveryyear','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-16T10:09:39Z','2026-10-17T08:43:45Z','Marking the International Day for Disaster Risk Reduction, the UN chief stressed that “as climate and disaster risks multiply, building safer dwellings is the shared responsibility of governments, developers, engineers and communities”.',3.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(7,'https://www.preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/diagnosing-region-specific-flood-influencing-factors','https://preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/diagnosing-region-specific-flood-influencing-factors','Diagnosing region-specific flood influencing factors in a volcanic island using explainable machine learning','diagnosingregionspecificfloodinfluencingfactorsinavolcanicislandusingexplainablemachinelearning','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-16T09:56:00Z','2026-10-17T08:43:45Z','This study applies a grid-based, explainable machine learning framework to Jeju Island and finds that rainfall, groundwater, and proximity to water bodies are key, regionally variable factors for flood occurrence, supporting nuanced flood risk management.',3.0,'classified',NULL,10);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(8,'https://www.preventionweb.net/drr-community-voices/rethinking-disaster-reconstruction-nepal-building-back-changing-climate','https://preventionweb.net/drr-community-voices/rethinking-disaster-reconstruction-nepal-building-back-changing-climate','Rethinking disaster reconstruction in Nepal: Building back for a changing climate','rethinkingdisasterreconstructioninnepalbuildingbackforachangingclimate','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-16T09:15:21Z','2026-10-17T08:43:45Z','Repeated floods in Nepal’s mountain and hill regions made the author raise a fundamental question: should reconstruction simply restore what was lost, or should it address the changing risks that made those communities vulnerable in the first place?',3.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(9,'https://www.preventionweb.net/event/resilience-starts-home-webinar-international-day-disaster-risk-reduction-2026','https://preventionweb.net/event/resilience-starts-home-webinar-international-day-disaster-risk-reduction-2026','Resilience Starts at Home: Webinar for International Day for Disaster Risk Reduction 2026','resiliencestartsathomewebinarforinternationaldayfordisasterriskreduction2026','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-16T07:48:41Z','2026-10-17T08:43:45Z','In response to the International Day for Disaster Risk Reduction 2026, CCYPS and HADEUS Vietnam are organizing the webinar Resilience Starts at Home to raise awareness of risks within people’s own homes.',1.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(10,'https://www.preventionweb.net/organization/health-alliance-diversity-equity-and-inclusion','https://preventionweb.net/organization/health-alliance-diversity-equity-and-inclusion','Health Alliance for Diversity, Equity and Inclusion','healthalliancefordiversityequityandinclusion','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-16T07:40:03Z','2026-10-17T08:43:45Z','HADEUS Vietnam is a youth-led organization promoting equity, diversity and inclusion in health sector (health equity) in Viet Nam.',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(11,'https://www.preventionweb.net/organization/climate-conscious-young-professionals-society','https://preventionweb.net/organization/climate-conscious-young-professionals-society','Climate Conscious Young Professionals Society','climateconsciousyoungprofessionalssociety','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-16T07:27:14Z','2026-10-17T08:43:45Z','The Climate Conscious Young Professionals Society (CCYPS) is a community organization that bridges the gap for young adults transitioning from student climate networks into the professional workforce.',1.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(12,'https://www.preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/un-declaration-sea-level-rise','https://preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/un-declaration-sea-level-rise','UN Declaration on Sea Level Rise','undeclarationonsealevelrise','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-15T16:14:54Z','2026-10-17T08:43:45Z','This declaration urges strengthening of global action on sea level rise, emphasizing four pillars: science, adaptation, livelihoods, and legal issues, and calls for enhanced support and coordinated responses for vulnerable communities.',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(13,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/5-expectations-cop-31-antalya','https://preventionweb.net/news/5-expectations-cop-31-antalya','5 expectations for COP 31 in Antalya','5expectationsforcop31inantalya','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-15T16:14:35Z','2026-10-17T08:43:45Z','As climate negotiations move from commitment to implementation, here are five expectations for COP31 in Antalya.',1.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(14,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/rewriting-rules-disaster-finance','https://preventionweb.net/news/rewriting-rules-disaster-finance','Rewriting the rules of disaster finance','rewritingtherulesofdisasterfinance','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-15T16:13:59Z','2026-10-17T08:43:45Z','Kenya’s new risk financing strategy funds disaster prevention as well as recovery, breaking with a model most of the field still follows.',1.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(15,'https://www.preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/principles-practice-financing-disaster-risk-reduction-and','https://preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/principles-practice-financing-disaster-risk-reduction-and','From principles to practice: Financing disaster risk reduction and residual risk','fromprinciplestopracticefinancingdisasterriskreductionandresidualrisk','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-15T16:12:57Z','2026-10-17T08:43:45Z','This report examines how national disaster risk management policies integrate disaster financing and residual risk, finding weak practical links and recommending improved coordination, clearer risk metrics, costings, and joint financing strategies.',1.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(16,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/mapping-risk-coastal-alaska-ready-next-tsunami','https://preventionweb.net/news/mapping-risk-coastal-alaska-ready-next-tsunami','Mapping the risk: Is coastal Alaska ready for the next tsunami?','mappingtheriskiscoastalalaskareadyforthenexttsunami','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-15T16:11:16Z','2026-10-17T08:43:45Z','Alaska scientists have launched an interactive tsunami map covering 66 coastal communities, highlighting flood risks and preparedness gaps to help local leaders strengthen evacuation planning and protect lives.',1.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(17,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/cities-are-sinking-citywide-averages-hide-real-problem','https://preventionweb.net/news/cities-are-sinking-citywide-averages-hide-real-problem','Cities are sinking – but citywide averages hide the real problem','citiesaresinking','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-15T15:20:26Z','2026-10-17T08:43:45Z','As cities continue to sink, we need to examine these changes at the local scale. Averages across a whole city can tell us how big the problem is, but knowing where the land is sinking fastest – and who lives there – is essential to deciding for response.',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(18,'https://www.preventionweb.net/drr-community-voices/resilience-about-having-more-choices-when-risk-arrives','https://preventionweb.net/drr-community-voices/resilience-about-having-more-choices-when-risk-arrives','Resilience is about having more choices when risk arrives','resilienceisabouthavingmorechoiceswhenriskarrives','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-15T13:11:17Z','2026-10-17T08:43:45Z','This blog resilience means having more choices when risks arise. Strengthening livelihoods, empowering women and protecting ecosystems helps households build financial security, manage uncertainty and adapt to changing circumstances.',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(19,'https://www.preventionweb.net/organization/european-society-medicine','https://preventionweb.net/organization/european-society-medicine','European Society of Medicine','europeansocietyofmedicine','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-15T11:34:44Z','2026-10-17T08:43:45Z','ESMED is a global medical community, supporting critical health research. Through their peer-reviewed journal, they publish groundbreaking research, evidence-based policy frameworks, and clinical guidelines that directly address global health challenges.',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(20,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/saving-lives-restoring-livelihoods-building-resilient-communities-indonesia','https://preventionweb.net/news/saving-lives-restoring-livelihoods-building-resilient-communities-indonesia','Saving lives, restoring livelihoods: building resilient communities in Indonesia','savinglivesrestoringlivelihoodsbuildingresilientcommunitiesinindonesia','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-14T14:37:21Z','2026-10-17T08:43:45Z','Between 2010 and 2025 floods in Indonesia claimed more than 1,700 lives and caused an estimated USD 5.8 billion in losses. ADB-backed forecasting systems now warn communities up to nine hours ahead, alongside livelihood support for affected households.',2.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(21,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/resilience-starts-home-building-safer-future-latin-america-and-caribbean','https://preventionweb.net/news/resilience-starts-home-building-safer-future-latin-america-and-caribbean','Resilience starts at home: building a safer future in Latin America and the Caribbean','resiliencestartsathomebuildingasaferfutureinlatinamericaandthecaribbean','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-14T14:36:57Z','2026-10-17T08:43:45Z','For this year’s International Day for Disaster Risk Reduction, UNDP describes how risk-informed housing and land-use planning is taking shape in Cuba, Jamaica and Venezuela, in a region where 81.2 per cent of the population lives in cities.',1.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(22,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/when-el-nino-hits-home-building-household-resilience-ahead-record-breaking-climate-event','https://preventionweb.net/news/when-el-nino-hits-home-building-household-resilience-ahead-record-breaking-climate-event','When El Niño hits home: building household resilience ahead of a record-breaking climate event','whenelninohitshomebuildinghouseholdresilienceaheadofarecordbreakingclimateevent','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-14T14:35:42Z','2026-10-17T08:43:45Z','Households absorb much of the cost of disasters: Post-Disaster Needs Assessments from 20 countries in Asia and the Pacific put about 40 per cent of impacts in social and productive sectors. ESCAP sets out three government interventions.',3.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(23,'https://www.preventionweb.net/event/xv-research-conference-disaster-risk-management-2026','https://preventionweb.net/event/xv-research-conference-disaster-risk-management-2026','XV Research Conference on Disaster Risk Management 2026','xvresearchconferenceondisasterriskmanagement2026','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-14T14:34:25Z','2026-10-17T08:43:45Z','Online, 14 October 2026, 13:30–16:40 Costa Rica time. The University of Costa Rica’s XV Research Conference on Disaster Risk Management presents recent research from Costa Rica, Paraguay, Chile and the United States. Free and open to all.',1.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(24,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/sinking-bangkok-how-historic-floods-exposed-cracks-citys-disaster-defenses','https://preventionweb.net/news/sinking-bangkok-how-historic-floods-exposed-cracks-citys-disaster-defenses','Sinking Bangkok: How historic floods exposed cracks in city’s disaster defenses','sinkingbangkokhowhistoricfloodsexposedcracksincitysdisasterdefenses','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-14T14:33:31Z','2026-10-17T08:43:45Z','Experts say that without major upgrades to flood defenses, the city will fall deeper into an annual pattern of chaos and paralysis as climate change takes hold.',4.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(25,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/2026-kumamoto-earthquake-problem-not-resource-shortage-lack-accessibility','https://preventionweb.net/news/2026-kumamoto-earthquake-problem-not-resource-shortage-lack-accessibility','2026 Kumamoto earthquake: The problem is not resource shortage but a lack of accessibility','2026kumamotoearthquaketheproblemisnotresourceshortagebutalackofaccessibility','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-14T14:32:11Z','2026-10-17T08:43:45Z','In the aftermath of a disaster, affected areas are trapped in a severe information vacuum. When roads are damaged and communications fail, entering the disaster zone and conducting onsite surveys doesn''t give an tell what help is necessary and where.',1.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(26,'https://www.preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/perceiving-protection-public-interpretation-institutions','https://preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/perceiving-protection-public-interpretation-institutions','Perceiving protection: Public interpretation of institutions in managed flood settings','perceivingprotectionpublicinterpretationofinstitutionsinmanagedfloodsettings','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-14T14:31:55Z','2026-10-17T08:43:45Z','This paper reviews 35 studies on public interpretations of institutional presence in flood-prone areas, finding that perceptions of risk, trust, and preparedness are shaped by how communities experience flood management and governance visibility.',1.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(27,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/how-rapid-financing-helped-madagascar-recover-after-devastating-cyclone-0','https://preventionweb.net/news/how-rapid-financing-helped-madagascar-recover-after-devastating-cyclone-0','How rapid financing helped Madagascar recover after a devastating cyclone','howrapidfinancinghelpedmadagascarrecoverafteradevastatingcyclone','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-14T14:31:38Z','2026-10-17T08:43:45Z','After Cyclone Gezani devastated Madagascar, pre-arranged financing programme, REPAIR, helped mobilize over US$15 million within seven days, supporting emergency assistance, cash-for-work activities and community-led recovery for more than 400,000 people.',1.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(28,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/extreme-el-ninos-are-coming-reaching-net-zero-sooner-means-facing-fewer-them','https://preventionweb.net/news/extreme-el-ninos-are-coming-reaching-net-zero-sooner-means-facing-fewer-them','Extreme El Niños are coming. Reaching net zero sooner means facing fewer of them','extremeelninosarecomingreachingnetzerosoonermeansfacingfewerofthem','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-14T14:30:52Z','2026-10-17T08:43:45Z','New modelling suggests the tropical Pacific could stay in an El Niño-like state for centuries even after net zero is reached, with a larger share of El Niño events turning extreme. The longer emissions take to fall, the more of them.',0.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(29,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/iit-madras-led-international-study-finds-atmospheric-air-pollution-levels-could-aid-improving','https://preventionweb.net/news/iit-madras-led-international-study-finds-atmospheric-air-pollution-levels-could-aid-improving','IIT Madras-led international study finds atmospheric air pollution levels could aid in improving urban flood forecasts','iitmadrasledinternationalstudyfindsatmosphericairpollutionlevelscouldaidinimprovingurbanfloodforecasts','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-14T14:30:34Z','2026-10-17T08:43:45Z','An Indian Institute of Technology Madras (IIT Madras)-led international study has found that atmospheric air pollution could play a critical role in improving the forecasting of rainfall and urban floods.',5.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(30,'https://www.preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/modeling-cascading-drought-effects-national-food-supply','https://preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/modeling-cascading-drought-effects-national-food-supply','Modeling cascading drought effects in a national food supply network using minimum cost flow','modelingcascadingdroughteffectsinanationalfoodsupplynetworkusingminimumcostflow','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-14T14:29:54Z','2026-10-17T08:43:45Z','This study presents a spatial network optimization approach to model extreme drought impacts on Sweden’s food supply chain, revealing that supply losses in the south translate to unmet demand in the north and highlighting new bottlenecks in distribution.',1.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(31,'https://www.preventionweb.net/event/12th-international-i-rec-conference','https://preventionweb.net/event/12th-international-i-rec-conference','The 12th International i-Rec Conference','the12thinternationalirecconference','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-14T14:29:40Z','2026-10-17T08:43:45Z','Adana, Türkiye, 3–7 May 2027. The 12th International i-Rec Conference examines how disaster memory shapes post-disaster reconstruction and vulnerability reduction, with a graduate workshop, field visits in Adana and Hatay, and student competitions.',1.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(32,'https://www.preventionweb.net/event/bousai-kokutai-2026-lets-dance-bousai-ondo-hachiko','https://preventionweb.net/event/bousai-kokutai-2026-lets-dance-bousai-ondo-hachiko','Bousai Kokutai 2026: Let’s Dance Bousai Ondo with HACHIKO!','bousaikokutai2026letsdancebousaiondowithhachiko','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-14T14:20:32Z','2026-10-17T08:43:45Z','Kurayoshi, Tottori, Japan, and online, 17 October 2026, 16:30–18:00 JST. A workshop at Bousai Kokutai 2026 uses a disaster-prevention song and a short film to teach shelter resilience, mutual aid and risk reduction through urban planning.',1.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(33,'https://www.preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/food-security-benefits-more-accurate-weather-forecasts','https://preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/food-security-benefits-more-accurate-weather-forecasts','Food security benefits of more accurate weather forecasts in the context of a changing climate','foodsecuritybenefitsofmoreaccurateweatherforecastsinthecontextofachangingclimate','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-14T14:18:29Z','2026-10-17T08:43:45Z','This paper analyzes household survey and meteorological data from Ethiopia, Tanzania, Uganda, and Bangladesh, finding that more accurate weather forecasts reduce crop losses and help farmers adjust labor hiring, especially during extreme weather events.',4.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(34,'https://www.preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/planning-next-disaster-household-preparedness-houston-area','https://preventionweb.net/publication/documents-and-publications/planning-next-disaster-household-preparedness-houston-area','Planning for the next disaster: Household preparedness in the Houston area','planningforthenextdisasterhouseholdpreparednessinthehoustonarea','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-14T14:18:14Z','2026-10-17T08:43:45Z','This survey assesses disaster preparedness among Houston-area households, finding most residents feel somewhat prepared but with disparities by income and location. Insights aim to guide leaders in addressing gaps and promoting equitable resilience.',1.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(35,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/south-africa-launches-first-climate-and-health-surveillance-platform-support-climate-health','https://preventionweb.net/news/south-africa-launches-first-climate-and-health-surveillance-platform-support-climate-health','South Africa launches first climate and health surveillance platform to support climate-health intelligence and decision-making','southafricalaunchesfirstclimateandhealthsurveillanceplatformtosupportclimatehealthintelligenceanddecisionmaking','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-14T14:17:50Z','2026-10-17T08:43:45Z','South Africa launched its first national Climate and Health Surveillance platform, a pioneering research and decision-support tool designed to strengthen the country’s ability to understand and respond to the growing health impacts of climate change.',1.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(36,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/monsoon-megacities-under-pressure-hydro-political-resilience-and-urban-inundation-risks','https://preventionweb.net/news/monsoon-megacities-under-pressure-hydro-political-resilience-and-urban-inundation-risks','Monsoon megacities under pressure: Hydro-political resilience and urban inundation risks in Bangkok','monsoonmegacitiesunderpressurehydropoliticalresilienceandurbaninundationrisksinbangkok','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-14T14:17:16Z','2026-10-17T08:43:45Z','On September 26th, following nearly 48 hours of continuous heavy rainfall, Bangkok was officially designated a disaster-affected zone following severe meteorological disruptions driven by an active low-pressure cell stalled across central Thailand.',3.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "items" VALUES(37,'https://www.preventionweb.net/news/when-doctors-are-also-survivors-inside-minds-residents-during-2023-turkiye-earthquake','https://preventionweb.net/news/when-doctors-are-also-survivors-inside-minds-residents-during-2023-turkiye-earthquake','When doctors are also survivors: Inside the minds of residents during the 2023 Türkiye earthquake','whendoctorsarealsosurvivorsinsidethemindsofresidentsduringthe2023turkiyeearthquake','preventionweb','PreventionWeb','en','2026-10-14T14:17:00Z','2026-10-17T08:43:45Z','A study of doctors’ experiences during the 2023 Türkiye earthquakes highlights gaps in disaster preparedness and calls for practical training, psychological support and policies that recognize healthcare workers may also be disaster survivors.',1.0,'filtered_out',NULL,NULL);
