ogy companies, researchers and international organizations in Tokyo on 1-2 October 2026 to discuss how AI and other emerging technologies can become practical disaster risk reduction tools. The workshop focused on pathways from technology to applied use in disaster risk reduction.", "system_names": [], "techniques": ["ml_dl", "other"], "title": "World: Tokyo workshop charts practical pathways for emerging technologies in disaster risk reduction", "value_added": "Explores how artificial intelligence and other emerging technologies can be translated into practical tools for reducing disaster risk.", "value_types": ["other"], "wmo_regions": ["II"]}');
